        "kind": "core-rule",
        "id": "keywords-in-attached-units"
      }
    ],
    "summary": "Keywords come only from models still in a unit: **destroyed** models stop lending theirs. This holds for a unit, which has every keyword of its models, and for an attached unit, which has every keyword of its component units.\n\nFor example, if a Rubric Marines unit's Aspiring Sorcerer is destroyed and no remaining model has **PSYKER**, the unit loses the **PSYKER** keyword.",
